# ========================================
#  Firebase Configuration (service account JSON)
#  Only PROJECT_ID, CLIENT_EMAIL and PRIVATE_KEY are used for push.
#  PRIVATE_KEY: keep the \n sequences and wrap the value in double quotes.
# ========================================
